  draft    : ldconfig's documented soname link layout and which link it calls the SONAME; not ldconfig's implementation, not the DT_SONAME tag
  registry : documented soname link layout (linker name → SONAME → real name) on glibc systems; not ldconfig's implementation and not the DT_SONAME tag
