  draft    : §DESCRIPTION paragraphs 2 and 3 (SONAME chain example and the sentence after it); man-pages 6.19, page dated 2026-08-03 (man7 footer "Linux man-pages 6.19"; tarball .TH footer "(unreleased)"; installed man-pages 6.19-1 identical to the tarball except that footer); tarball man-pages-6.19.tar.xz sha256 88a7c42ad2e03d8b96dc72d95e451f2d875ff0f43103a8eb8ac8242133bdcb05; man7 HTML sha256 6a81540a534692ed7cb6d5434275e08b3ade388311bdb88f1e4e506be2bfde38, fetched 2026-10-21
